    "field": "Climate change projections",
    "problem": "Despite South Asia's vulnerability to climate change, previous studies have focused mainly on summer, lacking a comprehensive analysis of projected annual and seasonal temperature and precipitation changes for the entire region and individual countries using the latest CMIP6 climate model dataset.",
    "method": "This study analyzes the multimodel ensemble from 27 CMIP6 models to examine projected twenty-first-century changes in temperature and precipitation over six South Asian countries under three future Shared Socioeconomic Pathway scenarios.",
    "task": "The task is to analyze the CMIP6 dataset to examine projected changes in temperature and precipitation over six South Asian countries during the twenty-first century under different future scenarios.",
